    88	/// Initialize a SharedGrid for the given font configuration. If the
    89	/// SharedGrid is not present it will be initialized with a ref count of
    90	/// 1. If it is present, the ref count will be incremented.
    91	///
    92	/// This is NOT thread-safe.
    93	///
    94	/// The returned data (key and grid) should never be freed. The memory is
    95	/// owned by the set and will be freed when the ref count reaches zero.
